  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for identification and formulation of an Action on Support to Civil Society in Pakistan (AAP 2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract inherited from multiple actions, related to: Support for identification and formulation of an Action on Support to Civil Society in Pakistan (AAP 2023) - The Support Measures and Cooperation Facility for Asia and the Pacific 2022, 2023 and 2024 provides the European Commission the possibility to finance small-scale activities that are needed for the achievement of the objectives of the Neighbourhood, Development and International Cooperation Instrument (NDICI-Global Europe) in those regions.</narrative>
  </description>
